  "description": "Warroad C Rival eTap AXS is the cure for the common road bike. The stiff, lightweight carbon frameset with Class 5™ VRS and our endurance road geometry blends performance for spirited riding with comfort for long days in the saddle on any road surface — it’s our best bike for gravel and road riding. Extra mounts on the frame and fork hold everything you need for long days out. Dual wheel size compatibility lets you run up to 700c x 35 mm or 650b x 47 mm wheels and tires, and SRAM’s Rival eTap AXS drivetrain feels superb and performs flawlessly, no matter where your wanderings take you.",
